ance Credential only: Dual Credential Multiple Subject & Mild/Moderate Support Credential only: Dual Credential Single Subject & Mild/Moderate Support Credential only: Mild/Moderate Support Needs Special Education Credential only: Multiple Subject Credential only: Single Subject MA in Education with Mild/Moderate Support Needs Special Education Credential MA in Education with Multiple Subject Credential MA in Education with Single Subject Credential MA in Education: Dual Credential Multiple Subject & Mild/Moderate Support MA in Education: Dual Credential Single Subject & Mild/Moderate Support Which campus location/option is most convenient to you?* Redlands- Main Campus Los Angeles San Francisco Bay Area Campus Online When do you plan to start?* Inter-Session 2027 Spring 2027 Summer 2027 Fall 2027 Inter-Session 2028 Spring 2028 Summer 2028 Fall 2028 By submitting this form, you are giving your express written consent without obligation for UofR to contact you regarding our educational programs and services using email, phone, text, or AI including automated technology for calls and/or texts to the mobile number(s) provided. For more details, including how to opt-out, read our privacy policy or contact an admissions advisor. FY student default First-Year Student Transfer Student TR student Default First-Year Student Transfer Student Text - HIDDEN & Default to Yes Yes No AI - HIDDEN & Default to Yes Yes No Deliver Type - HIDDEN & Default Not In SBS & SOE Programs Daytime Evening or Online Deliver Type - HIDDEN & Default to evening for SBS & SOE Daytime Evening or Online Submit Accessibility Statement Privacy Policy Policies & Disclosures Careers A non-profit, fully accredited education. All Content Copyright Woodbury University ©\n                2026 Woodbury University is now University of Redlands, Los Angeles. ×"
